# CRM

`crm/service.py` is the only place that creates or updates contacts. Do not import `crm/minimal_service.py` or `core/minimal_crm_service.py`.

Contact fields: id, user_id, email, name, phone, company, source, stage, score, created_at, updated_at, last_contact, notes, tags, metadata.

- Email is unique, case-insensitive.
- An update merges into the existing contact.
- Look up by id or email. Do not add a join when a lookup will do.

There is no `crm/workflows/` package. Add one only when CRM complexity requires it.
